    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "You can do that by creating custom buffer-local source by defining it in [buffer-local config, i.e. `vim.b.minidiff_config`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/7a75a970d0bae09ef579e41dbb20551bdf596f31/doc/mini-diff.txt#L49-L51). With something like this (assuming `buf_id` is identifier of a target buffer and `ref_text` contains \"freezed\" reference text):\n\n```lua\nlocal source = { name = 'manual', attach = function() MiniDiff.set_ref_text(buf_id, ref_text) end }\nvim.b.minidiff_config = { source = source }\nMiniDiff.disable(buf_id)\nMiniDiff.enable(buf_id)\n```",
